# No build-time env vars are currently required.
#
# Google Sync uses per-install OAuth credentials entered in
# Settings > Sync > Google Sync — no env vars required. The OAuth
# callback rides a one-shot loopback HTTP listener on 127.0.0.1, so the
# redirect URI registered on your Google OAuth client must be exactly
# http://127.0.0.1 (no port — Google wildcards loopback ports at runtime).
